#. module: l10n_ro_stock_account_landed_cost_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ro_stock_account_landed_cost_account.field_res_company__l10n_ro_landed_cost_method
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ro_stock_account_landed_cost_account.field_res_config_settings__l10n_ro_landed_cost_method
msgid ""
"How a landed cost entry that would credit a class 6 (expense) account is generated:\n"
"- Standard: native Odoo behaviour (stock valuation = class 6);\n"
"- Through intermediary account: the class 6 credit is routed through a technical intermediary account, producing two clean balanced notes (stock valuation = intermediary and intermediary = class 6) that export correctly to SAGA. Requires the intermediary account below."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ro_stock_account_landed_cost_account
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ro_stock_account_landed_cost_account.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"How the landed cost entry that would credit a class 6 (expense) account is "
"generated. 'Standard' keeps the native Odoo behaviour (stock valuation = "
"class 6). 'Through intermediary account' routes the class 6 credit through a"
" technical intermediary account, producing two clean balanced notes that "
"export correctly to SAGA."
msgstr ""

